    principled statistical inference. A minimal attention-only transformer implements
    a two-stage empirical Bayes denoiser: <em>depth</em> refines a particle approximation
    to the unknown data prior via reverse diffusion, while a long-range <em>skip connection</em>
    queries it for Bayes-optimal posterior averaging.
  </p>
